{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"5b995e7a-6ff3-47a3-9c79-9b853a55b8c7","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have fixed the prompt caching issue and documented the solution in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-fzermi/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Cause \u0026 Fix\n\n* **Root Cause:** In [`bot.py`](file:///tmp/h-fzermi/bot.py), `build_system(a, today)` concatenated the static coaching instructions (`INSTRUCTIONS`) and the athlete context (`athlete_context(a, today)`) into a single text block with `cache_control: {\"type\": \"ephemeral\"}`. When `save_fact` appended a fact to `a.facts`, the text of this combined block was modified, invalidating the cached prefix and forcing subsequent calls to recreate the cache for the entire prompt.\n* **Fix:** In [`build_system`](file:///tmp/h-fzermi/bot.py#L130-L137), split the system prompt into two separate text blocks:\n  1. A static block containing `INSTRUCTIONS` marked with `{\"cache_control\": {\"type\": \"ephemeral\"}}`.\n  2. A dynamic block containing `athlete_context(a, today)`.\n\nBecause the static instructions prefix remains unchanged across `save_fact` calls, it is reliably read from cache without being evicted by memory updates.\n","duration_seconds":100.987988,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":200824,"output_tokens":2537,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":413969,"total_tokens":203361}}}
